{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21283","headline":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 三 · 元稹","name":"顺宗至德大圣大安孝皇帝挽歌词三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七月悲风起，凄凉万国人。\n羽仪经巷内，輼𨍇转城闉\n暝色依陵早，秋声入辂新。\n自嗟同草木，不识永贞春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}